# AGENTS.md

Notes for AI agents working in this repository.

## Project

AiRouter4J — Java (Maven, Spring Boot) backend under `src/`, Vue 3 + TypeScript frontend under `frontend/`.
Documentation site (mkdocs) lives in `docs/zh` and `docs/en`.

## Agent skills

### Issue tracker

Issues and specs live as local markdown files under `.scratch/`. See `docs/agents/issue-tracker.md`.

### Triage labels

Triage state is recorded as a `Status:` line in each issue file, using the five canonical role names (`needs-triage`, `needs-info`, `ready-for-agent`, `ready-for-human`, `wontfix`). See `docs/agents/triage-labels.md`.

### Domain docs

Single-context: one `GLOSSARY.md` and one `docs/adr/` at the repo root. See `docs/agents/domain.md`.
